direction: down
title: "C23 cohort retirement: known join is narrower than all-reader grace"
"Old roster" -> "Closed collective": "close membership and drain internal readers / descendants"
"Closed collective" -> "Worker exit": "departing thread exits before native cleanup"
"Worker exit" -> "Known join": "one OS-thread termination receipt"
"Known join" -> "Storage handoff": "transfer still objects and accounting; require RC admission"
"Storage handoff" -> "Domain retirement": "also close and drain exported observers"
"Unknown join / escaped scanner" -> "Retained custody": "no cleanup or gate reuse; no invented completion"
"Public cleanup API" -> "External entry authority": "first metadata load must already be safe"
